{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52552","headline":"忠烈操 · 陈元光","name":"忠烈操","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乾生男子坤生姝，国有君王家有夫。\n委[质]（盾）结褵托其躯，三纲五常与命俱。\n一朝凶变违常途，匡扶弗得将何如？\n英英烈烈[他]（地）虑无。\n舍生取义终不[渝]（瑜）。\n《柏舟》之诗王蠋语，千古芳名耀青史。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52552.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52552","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}